LANGUAGE English

BOOK Gallery ORDERED NO KEEP LOOPED
	PAGE PlaceGallery
		TRIGGERED BY @PlaceGallery
	
		TEXT """
			As the door opens, dust slowly drifts to the floor. Lots of
			it. If you were still concerned about cleaning, you'd be horrified
			at the amount of work ahead of you.
			
			The room behind the door once lived up its expectations. The room
			is--or was--stately, with high ceilings, beautiful
			paintings, and furniture and rugs that look both rich and
			comfortable. Dim light from the windows reflects off the dust,
			giving the room an unearthly quality. The glowing dust make the
			room feel more rundown that it actually is.
			
			Place the {c:TileGallery} tile, then remove all
			Explore tokens leading to this room.
		"""
	
		REMOVE TokenExploreGalleryViaHall1 AFTER
		REMOVE TokenExploreGalleryViaFoyer AFTER
		ADD TileFoyer
		exploredGallery = TRUE
	END PlaceGallery

	PAGE PlaceGalleryViaHall1
		IF exploredGalleryViaHall1 THEN PAGE IS VISIBLE

		TEXT """
			Across the room is another door. Place an Explore token as
			indicated.
		"""
		
		ADD TokenExploreFoyerViaGallery
	END PlaceGalleryViaHall1

	PAGE PlaceGalleryCoatRoom
		TEXT """
			A coat room sits in the corner across from you. Place an Explore
			token as indicated.
		"""
		
		ADD TokenExploreCoatRoom
	END PlaceGalleryCoatRoom
		
	PAGE PlaceGalleryDVM
		TEXT """
			The two divans are upholstered with once-beautiful cloth... but now
			they are dirty and moth-eaten. A pile of junk sits on a small table
			between them. Place a Search token as indicated.
		"""
		
		ADD TokenSearchGalleryDVM
		TRIGGER @MoveAfterExplore
		EXIT
	END PlaceGalleryDVM

	PAGE PlaceCoatRoom
		TRIGGERED BY @PlaceCoatRoom
		
		TEXT """
			The coat room still has a number of coats hung neatly on one side.
			Shoes and hangers are scattered on the floor. Remove this Explore
			token.

			A half-filled box sits in one of the corners. Place a Search token as
			indicated.
		"""
		
		REMOVE TokenExploreCoatRoom
		ADD TokenSearchCoatRoomEvidence
		TRIGGER @MoveAfterExplore
		EXIT
	END PlaceCoatRoom

	PAGE SearchDVM
		TRIGGERED BY @SearchGalleryDVM
		
		PROLOG "A pile of junk sits on the table between the divans."
		
		TEXT """
			Among the tools, handkerchiefs, and ashtrays are a number of small
			books. One of them... <i>feels</i> different than the others. It is
			old and worn, but you get the sense it possesses great power.

			Gain the {c:QItemDVM} Common Item, then discard this Search token.
			An investigator with the {c:QItemDVM} can interact with it in the
			app.
		"""
		
		REMOVE TokenSearchGalleryDVM
		foundDVM = TRUE AFTER
	END SearchDVM
	
	PAGE SearchCoatRoomEvidence
		TRIGGERED BY @SearchCoatRoomEvidence
		PROLOG "
			This box is half-full of things you might find in a coat room:
			brushes, shoe polish, and...
		"""
	
		TEXT """
			Among other items, you find a pair of shoes caked with mud and a
			bloody handkerchief. Looking closer, you see that the handkerchief
			was used to wipe blood from the shoes.

			Gain the {c:QItemEvidenceCoatRoom} Unique Item, then discard this
			Search token.
		"""
		
		REMOVE TokenSearchCoatRoomEvidence
		EXIT
	END SearchCoatRoomBox
END Gallery